  "id": "0086-seed-book",
  "description": "Seed the books, shelved on the furniture that holds them.",
  "rationale": "shelf_item_id points at house.furniture, so a book can only be shelved on something that is actually a shelf or a bookcase. One book has no ISBN, which is the case a unique constraint over a nullable column has to tolerate: several nulls are not duplicates. Every book starts at home -- 0096 is what lends two of them out. Ids come from the 7000-7099 block.",
